NOTE ON SCOPE

This license covers only the original work in this repository: the tools in
tools/, the RomRaider definition in definitions/, and the documentation in
docs/ and README.md.

It does NOT cover:

  - rom/91D1206000_5EAT.bin — Subaru/Fuji Heavy Industries firmware, included
    for interoperability and repair research. All rights remain with its owner.

  - decompiled/full_decompile.c — machine-generated output derived from the
    above binary, and carrying the same status.
